WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.196
- I do a lot of training
for many corporations,

00:00:05.196 --> 00:00:07.223
and I conduct sales
seminars and I've heard

00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:10.356
all kind of guys doing
techniques and training,

00:00:10.356 --> 00:00:13.000
people techniques of how to close sales,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.832
and how to work with them and
begin to control the sale,

00:00:16.832 --> 00:00:18.632
and how to ask for the close.

00:00:18.632 --> 00:00:20.071
Let me share something with you.

00:00:20.071 --> 00:00:22.072
You can learn all the
techniques in the world.

00:00:22.072 --> 00:00:24.822
If you don't believe in yourself,

00:00:26.557 --> 00:00:28.327
it won't happen for you.

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.755
I learned all of it.

00:00:30.755 --> 00:00:33.701
That's why I do a training
called Focus on the Seller.

00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:38.394
You've got to focus on you,
and as you convince you,

00:00:38.394 --> 00:00:42.543
as you sell yourself every
day, every day, every day,

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:44.124
you will begin to see a difference

00:00:44.124 --> 00:00:45.974
in the things that you're doing.

00:00:45.974 --> 00:00:48.946
Selling yourself on your
ability to perform a job,

00:00:48.946 --> 00:00:52.334
to achieve a certain objective,
telling yourself every day,

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:56.303
"Here I go again and I got what it takes.

00:00:56.303 --> 00:01:00.569
This is my day and nothing
out here is going to stop me."

00:01:00.569 --> 00:01:03.569
(triumphant music)

